  "description": "<p>A TypeScript command-line tool over the Cloudflare Browser Rendering API and Workers AI <code>tomarkdown</code>. It runs asynchronous site crawls; synchronous single-page operations that scrape elements, return markdown, rendered HTML, links, structured JSON, PDFs, screenshots and snapshots; and conversion of local files to markdown.</p>",
